 Steering enters a running turn at its next checkpoint. A false return means the message was not accepted; each ingress must apply its documented queue/new-turn policy rather than drop it. Query isBusy is not an atomic steering acceptance test.
 
+A local host may supply `runTurn.beforeRun(fresh)` to check a precondition
+under the session FIFO before inference or mutation. A rejection prevents the
+turn from starting; cancellation is checked before and after this awaited hook.
+Goal mode refuses this option rather than silently bypassing it. The hook does
+not lock external files or replace ordinary tool permission enforcement.
+
 ## Resources
 
